1
00:00:01,231 --> 00:00:04,234
How does he know
"Wild Stallion"?

2
00:00:04,236 --> 00:00:06,187
[Wild Stallion]

3
00:00:11,177 --> 00:00:12,804
Someone brought you up today.

4
00:00:12,804 --> 00:00:13,722
Who?

5
00:00:13,722 --> 00:00:16,725
A pro player. Jeong-min Lee.

6
00:00:16,725 --> 00:00:18,018
Oh...

7
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:20,103
that guy.

8
00:00:21,354 --> 00:00:24,357
You know him?

9
00:00:24,357 --> 00:00:25,859
Get to know him.

10
00:00:25,859 --> 00:00:27,610
He's decent.

11
00:00:38,357 --> 00:00:41,318
We're trying something
a bit special today.

12
00:00:41,583 --> 00:00:43,251
Special?

13
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:45,587
Balance training.

14
00:00:45,587 --> 00:00:48,923
We're going to work on
your kick posture.

15
00:00:50,204 --> 00:00:53,207
Think I can manage that?

16
00:00:53,208 --> 00:00:56,086
You've got me.

17
00:00:56,087 --> 00:00:58,673
Hold my shoulder.

18
00:00:58,674 --> 00:01:01,635
Adjust your knee

19
00:01:01,636 --> 00:01:06,336
ankle at 90 degrees...
imagine the ball...

20
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:08,488
and kick!

21
00:01:12,166 --> 00:01:13,584
Looks fun.

22
00:01:13,585 --> 00:01:16,588
Mind if I join in?
